    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae What is Tenra AI Multichat?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tenra AI Multichat</strong> is a real-time chat overlay for streamers who go live on <strong>YouTube, Twitch, TikTok, and Trovo</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It gathers all messages from every platform and displays them in one clean, customizable chat \u2014 both inside the app and as an overlay for <strong>OBS or TikTok Live Studio</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a beginner or a seasoned streamer, it helps you <strong>stay connected with your audience</strong> across all platforms, without missing a moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Unified chat</strong> from multiple platforms \u2014 all in one place<br>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Fully customizable look</strong> \u2014 show/hide platform logos, color accents, avatars, gift icons, and more<br>\ud83e\uddfc <strong>Spam filter</strong> \u2014 keep your chat clean and readable<br>\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f <strong>Voiceover support</strong> \u2014 reads messages aloud with natural-sounding voices<br>\ud83e\udde0 <strong>AI Chat Summarizer</strong> \u2014 lets you know what\u2019s going on when chat moves too fast<br>\ud83c\udfad Choose different <strong>personalities</strong> for AI summaries \u2014 like \u201ccool buddy\u201d, \u201cgangster\u201d, or \u201csilly friend\u201d<br>\ud83c\udf81 <strong>Donation &amp; Subscription Alerts</strong> for TikTok \u2014 complete with sound, animation, and text<br>\ud83c\udf9a\ufe0f Adjustable <strong>chat widget height and zoom</strong>, with theme selection<br>\ud83d\udcbb Built for <strong>OBS &amp; TikTok Live Studio</strong> integration<br>\ud83d\udd27 Designed for Windows with a lightweight, user-friendly interface</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Platform Display Options</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose <strong>how platforms are shown</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By <strong>logo</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By <strong>color only</strong> (YouTube = red, TikTok = blue, Twitch = purple, Trovo = green)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or keep it completely <strong>neutral</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This gives you full control and <strong>avoids platform conflict rules</strong> when needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The app supports login with Google and Steam accounts.&quot;</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae What is Tenra AI Multichat?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tenra AI Multichat</strong> is a real-time chat overlay for streamers who go live on <strong>YouTube, Twitch, TikTok, and Trovo</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It gathers all messages from every platform and displays them in one clean, customizable chat \u2014 both inside the app and as an overlay for <strong>OBS or TikTok Live Studio</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a beginner or a seasoned streamer, it helps you <strong>stay connected with your audience</strong> across all platforms, without missing a moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Unified chat</strong> from multiple platforms \u2014 all in one place<br>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Fully customizable look</strong> \u2014 show/hide platform logos, color accents, avatars, gift icons, and more<br>\ud83e\uddfc <strong>Spam filter</strong> \u2014 keep your chat clean and readable<br>\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f <strong>Voiceover support</strong> \u2014 reads messages aloud with natural-sounding voices<br>\ud83e\udde0 <strong>AI Chat Summarizer</strong> \u2014 lets you know what\u2019s going on when chat moves too fast<br>\ud83c\udfad Choose different <strong>personalities</strong> for AI summaries \u2014 like \u201ccool buddy\u201d, \u201cgangster\u201d, or \u201csilly friend\u201d<br>\ud83c\udf81 <strong>Donation &amp; Subscription Alerts</strong> for TikTok \u2014 complete with sound, animation, and text<br>\ud83c\udf9a\ufe0f Adjustable <strong>chat widget height and zoom</strong>, with theme selection<br>\ud83d\udcbb Built for <strong>OBS &amp; TikTok Live Studio</strong> integration<br>\ud83d\udd27 Designed for Windows with a lightweight, user-friendly interface</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Platform Display Options</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose <strong>how platforms are shown</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By <strong>logo</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By <strong>color only</strong> (YouTube = red, TikTok = blue, Twitch = purple, Trovo = green)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or keep it completely <strong>neutral</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This gives you full control and <strong>avoids platform conflict rules</strong> when needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The app supports login with Google and Steam accounts.&quot;</p>",
